- `AUTH SMOKE = NON VERIFICATO.` No already-authenticated browser session was
  available; no account or fixture was created for smoke testing. This also
  covers D6: the authenticated mobile shell is verified by unit and source
  contract tests only. Nobody has seen the header, the bar or the avatar render
